# hgp_qldpc27 — Tillich-Zémor 하이퍼그래프곱 qLDPC [[27,4,3]] |0_L⟩ prep (HGP(Hamming[7,4,3]×rep[3])). §3k P6 hypergraph-product 대형 개창, 기봉인 qldpc_hgp([[8,1,2]])의 거리-3 대형 확장. Tier-2 CLIFFORD (정준 stabilizer tableau, dense 2^27 불필요). ★선검증: CSS(Hx Hz^T=0)·k=4·양 transpose trivial→d=3 보존(비대칭 회피)·weight≤2 logical 부재. plan=X-안정자 RREF H·CNOT, no MatrixGate, 신규 module 0. witness=hgp_observe(CSS·거리·|0_L⟩ stabilized, 오라클 독립).
```python id=bloq
from qualtran import BloqBuilder
from qualtran.bloqs.basic_gates import Hadamard, CNOT
bb = BloqBuilder()
qs = [bb.add_register(f'q{i}', 1) for i in range(27)]
qs[0] = bb.add(Hadamard(), q=qs[0])
qs[0], qs[6] = bb.add(CNOT(), ctrl=qs[0], target=qs[6])
qs[0], qs[12] = bb.add(CNOT(), ctrl=qs[0], target=qs[12])
qs[0], qs[18] = bb.add(CNOT(), ctrl=qs[0], target=qs[18])
